// in load():
items = await Parser.parse(data)
```

For that to compile, `Parser` and `Item` must be `nonisolated`, because under main-actor-by-default they are main-isolated. `Item` must also be a `Sendable` value type, which a struct of plain values is automatically. Don't add this speculatively. Parsing on main is fine unless profiling says otherwise.

